Bug 2067502: Tolerate orphaned extension origins during temporary storage initialization. r=dom-storage-reviewers,asuth

Orphaned moz-extension storage directories left behind after extension
uninstall could fatally block QuotaManager temporary storage initialization.

This also addresses the remaining concerns of bug 1521541. Thanks to Tom Tung
for the original work there.

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D330095

